post.description:
Three steps, and the file never passes through the API:
1. this call — the server checks the kind and the declared size and answers with a signed link;
2. `PUT {uploadUrl}` with the file as the body and exactly `Content-Type: {contentType}`;
   for a video with `withThumbnail` — also a frame (JPEG or PNG) to `thumbnailUploadUrl`;
3. `POST /api/media/uploads/{attachmentId}/complete`.

Limits: `Media:MaxFileSizeMb` (100 MB), photos `Media:MaxPhotoSizeMb` (20 MB),
`Media:MaxPendingUploads` unfinished uploads per user. Voice needs `durationMs`;
video — `width` and `height` if known.

Errors: `400 INVALID_MEDIA`, `400 FILE_TOO_LARGE`, `409 TOO_MANY_UPLOADS`,
`503 MEDIA_UNAVAILABLE` — the server has no file storage.
